OL,3,GNEWSA'We've released our debut album - 
OL,4,Anearly 40 years after it was recorded' 
OL,6,FAn Edinburgh band have reformed after  
OL,7,Fdecades to finally release their debut 
OL,8,Falbum that was recorded in the 1980s.  
OL,10,FThe Catburgers have named the nine     
OL,11,Fupbeat songs after the town where they 
OL,12,Fplayed their favourite gig of the time 
OL,13,F- Galashiels.                          
OL,15,FStuart Macgregor, Robert Jones, Jeff   
OL,16,FDuffy and Keith Burns were rising stars
OL,17,Fof the Scottish music scene, regularly 
OL,18,Fheadlining shows in London, Glasgow and
OL,19,FAberdeen.                              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
